The [`h3-py-notebooks` repo](https://github.com/uber/h3-py-notebooks) has notebooks for producing the [average cell area table](https://github.com/uber/h3-py-notebooks/blob/master/notebooks/stats_tables/avg_area_table.ipynb) and the [min/max area table](https://github.com/uber/h3-py-notebooks/blob/master/notebooks/stats_tables/extreme_hex_area.ipynb).

